  "solution": {
    "text": "According to Faraday&rsquo;s law of electromagnetic induction, E.M.F. = &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />so &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>&#981;</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mn>E</mn><mn>M</mn><mn>F</mn><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mn>T</mn><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mn>W</mn><mi>q</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mo>[</mo><mn>T</mn><mo>]</mo></mrow></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>&#981;</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>M</mn><mn>L</mn><msup><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mn>T</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>A</mn><mn>T</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mo>[</mo><mn>T</mn><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mn>M</mn><mn>L</mn><msup><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mn>T</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mn>A</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></math>",
